Show policy or review pending changes and history settings

Usage: shield policy [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  show      Show the policy, live reviews and history settings
  review    Review a live change or history settings in a terminal
  reject    Reject a live proposal after confirmation
  evaluate  Preview a normalized request from a JSON input/context object; never executes it
  compare   Compare the current policy with a proposal's, or a proposal's two sides, without changing anything
  help      Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --project <PROJECT>              Select a project; otherwise discover the nearest enrolled ancestor
      --json                           Print one JSON result; commands that change policy refuse JSON mode
      --debug-log-dir <DEBUG_LOG_DIR>  Write private per-process diagnostics in this directory (also `SHIELD_DEBUG_LOG_DIR`)
      --no-debug-log                   Disable diagnostic logging, including automatic debug-build logs
      --cache-dir <CACHE_DIR>          Folder for this project's compiled policy plans, chosen at init or MCP setup
  -h, --help                           Print help
